"text": "She started filling the rooms with water until there was enough that a dolphin could swim. Then she moved in with him. After that, she painted her face white and outlined her mouth in black so he could watch her lips as she repeated words. She was trying to test whether a dolphin could speak like a human. And slowly, he actually began copying her sounds. But then the experiment lost funding. But after living together for months, they had grown close. The dolphin was moved to a smaller tank with little sunlight. After that, he began getting worse. And just weeks after they were separated, the dolphin died.",
